5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick a new service! I want to make sure we choose something that really lasts and stays reliable for everyone. I'll look into winter road closures and bus links!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we aren't merely reinventing the wheel, I shall examine the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll be looking into the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. It's important to know if we actually have the expertise to manage these proposals.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree that we need a sustainable plan. To understand our financial stability and how we can maintain a service long-term, I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment, and the running and equipment lines.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to make sure we don't leave anyone behind. I'll look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, and also the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Does anyone else think we should check the delivery windows? I'm a bit worried about things getting delayed. @Daisuke, do you think that's the most important thing to check for the people who can't reach us?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, while delays are tedious, I suspect the historical data on our previous attempts will be far more illuminating. @Daisuke, I believe your focus on access and timing is a prudent complement to my research.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, worrying about delivery windows is a bit narrow. I'm more concerned with whether we have the actual skills on staff to run these services once they arrive. Logic suggests that's the real bottleneck.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, you make a fair point about skills, but we must also ensure the funding structure doesn't collapse after the first year. I believe my focus on the grants and budget lines will address that.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think the delivery windows are just one part. I'm more worried about who can actually get to the library and when. I hope the room bookings will show if we're missing people.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"That makes sense, @Daisuke! I just want everything to go smoothly. I'm still really curious about those bus links and the roads, because if people can't get to us, the best service in the world won't help!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, @Yumi. Accessibility is the cornerstone of public service. I merely hope that by looking at the outreach records, we can see if bringing the service to the people is more viable than bringing the people to us.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, that's a reasonable hypothesis. However, if the outreach failed because of a lack of qualified supervision, the location was irrelevant. I'll see if our current roster can actually support such an expansion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we are all looking at different pieces of the same puzzle. I will focus on the financial framework to ensure that whatever we decide is not just a temporary success, but a permanent asset.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. I just hope that by looking at the catalogue use and the bookings, we can find a way to reach the people who can't make it in during the day.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I think we've got a great plan! We're covering money, skills, history, and access. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can pick the best possible service for everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. We have cast a wide net. I look forward to seeing if the ghosts of our past initiatives provide a map for our future success.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm satisfied with the distribution. Let's see if the data supports a logical choice or if we're just guessing. I'll be waiting for the results.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I am also satisfied. We have a comprehensive approach that balances logistics, finance, and human resources. I look forward to reviewing the findings with you all.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the information helps us make the right choice. I'll do my best to share what I find.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
