86,3,4,talk,Minako,,My vote is for the Language Learning Circles. It is the only proposal that ensures long-term financial stability and operational viability.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
